{
  "project": {
    "name": "Pullover Hoodie",
    "slug": "hoodie-pullover",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "engine": "fc",
    "description": {
      "en": "FC-100 rank #5. The sweatshirt block plus a two-panel hood whose neck edge is solved to match the measured neck opening, and a kangaroo pocket cut on fold. Cuffs and hem band are derived ribs; the hood finishes the neckline.\n\nOfficial visualizer and configurator: Fashion Cabinet",
      "es": "Rango #5 del FC-100. El bloque de sudadera más una capucha de dos paneles cuyo borde de cuello se resuelve para coincidir con la abertura medida del escote, y bolsa canguro cortada al doblez. Puños y pretina son ribs derivados; la capucha remata el escote.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Fashion Cabinet",
      "fr": "Rang #5 du FC-100. Le bloc du sweat plus une capuche deux panneaux dont le bord d'encolure est résolu pour coïncider avec l'ouverture d'encolure mesurée, et une poche kangourou coupée au pli. Poignets et bord de bas sont des côtes dérivées ; la capuche finit l'encolure.\n\nVisualiseur et configurateur officiel : Fashion Cabinet",
      "pt": "Posto #5 do FC-100. O bloco do moletom mais um capuz de dois painéis cuja borda de pescoço é resolvida para casar com a abertura de pescoço medida, e um bolso canguru cortado na dobra. Punhos e faixa de barra são canelados derivados; o capuz acaba o decote.\n\nVisualizador e configurador oficial: Fashion Cabinet"
    },
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": [
      "hoodie",
      "fleece",
      "hood",
      "fc100",
      "hyperobject",
      "commons"
    ],
    "attribution": {
      "author": "Innovaciones MADFAM",
      "license": "CERN-OHL-W-2.0",
      "lineage": [
        {
          "source": "Original draft for Fashion Cabinet",
          "license": "original"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
